                            ],
                            Label: "vow_test_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Descend",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The second vow is nourishment. A bond that is not fed is a debt, not a devotion - let your companion be well fed before the water weighs it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "We starved once, keeping vigil, and learned what the light thinks of hunger offered as a gift. It thinks nothing of it. Feed what you love. If the water does not answer you, the vows were never spoken - return to the first of us, above."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "The Second Vow - Nourishment",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
